<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00590">
	<title>Smart Cruise Control</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>While the vehicle is <term translate="no">ON</term>, tap <menucascade><uicontrol>Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver Assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driving Convenience</uicontrol><uicontrol>Smart Cruise Control</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system screen to set the distance, acceleration, and reaction speed.</p>
	</conbody>
